            <div xml:id="d53">

                <pb facs="0148" n="44" sameAs="frus:frus1932v03/pg44"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">793.94 Commission/35: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Consul at Geneva (Gilbert) to the Secretary of
                            State</hi></head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Geneva</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1932-01-22T09:00:00+01:00">January 22, 1932—9
                        a.m.</date><lb/>[Received 10:35 a.m.]</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>24. Department’s 18, January 20, 5 p.m.</p>
                <list>
                    <label>1.</label>
                    <item>Pursuant to General McCoy’s
                        request I yesterday attended the meeting of the Manchurian Commission, one
                        session in the morning and a concluding session in the afternoon which
                        lasted until a late hour. The Commission will not meet again here and the
                        Commissioners have left Geneva.</item>
                    <label>2.</label>
                    <item>I orally apprised the Commission of General
                            McCoy’s acceptance as a member and stated that I was formally
                        so informing the President of the Council.</item>
                    <pb facs="0149" n="45" xml:id="pg45"/>
                    <label>3.</label>
                    <item>As all of the members of the Commission voted for Lord Lytton as chairman I likewise acquiesced
                        in his designation, making it unanimous.</item>
                    <label>4.</label>
                    <item>I am preparing a telegram giving the chief points taken up in the meeting
                        and certain details concerning which it will be convenient for General McCoy to be informed.</item>
                </list>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                            >Gilbert</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
